    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_20051215.0102\n\nHONG KONG, Dec 15 , 2005\n\nHong Kong gold closes markedly lower\n\n\n\n\nHong Kong gold prices closed markedly lower Thursday at 501.50-502.00 US dollars an ounce, compared to Wednesday's close of 514.50-515.00 dollars an ounce.\n\nThe market opened at 504.30-504.80 dollars an ounce.",
